{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47272","headline":"游仙二十四首 九 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲超洞阳界，试鉴丹极表。\n赤帝跃火龙，炎官控朱鸟。\n导我升绦府，长躯出天杪。\n阳灵赫重晖，四达何皎皎。\n爲尔流飘风，羣生遂无夭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}